{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 9, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• European Countries: England (John Cabot, Walter Raleigh), France (Robert de La Salle, Jacques Cartier), Holland (Henry Hudson), Portugal (Juan Rodrigues Cabrillo), Spain (Cabeza de Vaca, Columbus, Juan de Onate, Ponce de Leon) • Motivations: discovery, power, religion, trade, wealth", "id": "u75", "furniture": false}
