{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 14, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Social and Economic Impacts: introduced diseases, new foods, new animals (e.g., cattle, horses, pigs), depopulation, spiritual crisis and Christianization, enslavement of indigenous peoples, trade and warfare • Political Impact: Powhatan Confederacy and wars with Powhatans in Virginia, Iroquois federation, King Philip’s War, Pontiac’s Rebellion", "id": "u82", "furniture": false}
