{"page": 7, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 15, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Law: importance of women’s work to family economy, inheritance rights, property rights, suffrage • Diversity: elite women, indentured servants, native women, slaves • Women: Abigail Adams, Esther Reed, Martha Ballard, Martha Washington, Mercy Otis Warren, Molly Pitcher, Phyllis Wheatley, Sarah Bache • Childbirth and Maternity: women as midwives", "id": "u172", "furniture": false}
