{"page": 9, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 1, "col": 3, "x": null, "text": "Content Standard SS.5.6.19.3 Explain the significance of key battles, alliances, and people on the outcome of the Revolutionary War", "id": "u202", "furniture": false}
{"page": 9, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 1, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Key Battles: Lexington and Concord, Cowpens, Boston, New York, Trenton/Princeton, Saratoga, Yorktown • Key Alliances: French, Spanish, Prussia • Key Figures: Cornwallis, Howe brothers, Lafayette, Washington", "id": "u203", "furniture": false}
